description: "K definition:\n\nmodule MAIN\n  syntax Int ::= r\"[0-9]+\" [token]\n  syntax Exp ::= Int\n\n  rule X:Exp ~> Y:Exp => Y:Exp ~> X:Exp\nendmodule\n"
---
\rewrites{SortK{}}(
  kseq{}(
    Lbl'Hash'SemanticCastToExp{}(VarX:SortK{}),
